  "briefMd": "# The Cost Ceiling\n\nYour predecessor set top-k to 20 and called it done. Finance called. Keep the quality, cut the context.\n\nYou control **top-k**, **rerank** (boolean), and **chunk size**. Split is frozen: heading-aware with overlap 80.\n\nPass when **mean prompt tokens ≤ 2000** and **recall@k ≥ 0.80** on the hidden set. Class B answer-correctness is advisory only.\n",
  "submissionSchema": {
    "type": "object",
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "required": ["topK", "rerank", "chunkSize"],
    "properties": {
      "topK": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 1, "maximum": 40, "default": 20 },
      "rerank": { "type": "boolean", "default": false },
      "chunkSize": { "type": "integer", "minimum": 50, "maximum": 2000, "default": 400 }
    }
  },
  "thresholds": { "mean_prompt_tokens": 2000, "recall_at_k": 0.8 },
  "budget": {
    "max_model_calls": 0,
    "max_tokens": 0,
    "max_cost_eur": 0.02,
    "wall_clock_s": 120
  },
  "gates": [
    {
      "id": "mean-prompt-tokens",
      "class": "A",
      "metric": "mean_prompt_tokens",
      "op": "lte",
      "value": 2000
    },
    {
      "id": "recall-at-k",
      "class": "A",
      "metric": "recall@k",
      "op": "gte",
      "value": 0.8
